# Trivy vulnerability exceptions (spec 006 / T002, FR-002).
#
# RISK-ACCEPTED, DOCUMENTED exceptions (owner decision 2026-08-17). users-api runs
# Spring Boot 1.5.6.RELEASE on Java 8. Every HIGH/CRITICAL below is only fixed in a
# version that requires Spring Boot 2/3 (Java 11/17) -- a framework migration, not a
# dependency bump, and explicitly out of scope for this feature (plan Complexity
# Tracking: "Legacy stacks limit remediation").
#
# Already remediated in-major (NOT listed here): logback 1.2.13, tomcat 8.5.51,
# jackson 2.8.11, spring 4.3.15, spring-data Ingalls-SR12, hibernate-validator
# 5.3.6, snakeyaml 1.26, bcprov 1.56 -- see pom.xml.
#
# FOLLOW-UP (tracked): migrate users-api to Spring Boot 2.7/3.x to remove these at
# the source. See docs/spring-boot-migration-followup.md.
# review-by: 2026-11-30


